  "manual.assortedstorage.chapter.locking.doors": "Every vanilla door has a locked form, and so do the doors Assorted Building Blocks adds. There is no item to craft. Simply put a padlock on a door that is already placed and it becomes one.\n\nA locked door will not open to a hand, a key of the wrong combination, or redstone.",
